    Num_D_MusicPlayer: ["chocolate chip cookies:l:srtex:this song contains sections from other   songs in the ost!","midnight snack'n:l:srtex:this is a pumped up version of the       original menu theme!","donut:l:srtex:a real head scratcher, the song is in 3°4","winning 2:l:srtex:sometime in march 2025, i decided to     remake the whole ost.","tres leches:l:srtex:i think it was a great idea, and i love  the new tracks!","a battle well fought:l:srtex:this is a scrapped track from the first  game. it lives again!","little scraggly guy:l:srtex:the first actual track made for the game.there is a version without the high-pass","panna cotta:l:srtex:the real winner was the friends we uhhh","executive showdown:ll:srtex:i hope you've already beaten the game!   this is a fun song we made with lyrics!","william's song (he wrote it):w:srtex:i didnt make this song, william from srt did.","nine lives:l:srtex:the boss music! i included a homage to a game i used to love!","executive sleepover:l:srtex:a fun jazz track! i was experimenting    with a sax.","hidden claws:l:srtex:a mysterious track intending to replicate50s detective jazz.","claws of commerce:l:srtex:strong bass, as well as many cat sounds.","baby kitty and lotta cat:l:srtex:baby kitty and lotta cat are two of my   old cats who passed away.","me-wow krispies:l:srtex:silly song made to be... well.. silly..","lemon bar:l:srtex:one fun thing i like doing with lemon, ishaving minor and major key switches to   show he is very playful!","neopolitan:l:srtex:bubbles... woah! this track shows the    chill vibe that deli brings...","biscotti:l:srtex:niko seemed like a jazz-head, so he gets some jazz!","mochi:lod:srtex:this song is meant to sound like a pq2   song, and features some singers from freesound.org!","apple pie (remix):l:srt:neko is a very silly cat, so her track isa mashup of various cat songs.","apple pie (jack0lanterne remix):lj:srt:special guest track! featuring a cool    artist i know...","fortune cookie:lp:srtex:legend needed some rebellious, skater    music! the singer is from freesound.org","turkish delight (remix):l:srt:a remix from srt, featuring retro        instruments!","frozen yogurt (remix):l:srt:a remix from srt, now having brass       instruments!","fruitcake:l:srt:krisp's stage was supposed to be crazy   and wild, so shoutout the no release     piano!","eclairs (remix):l:srt:a remix from srt, now going up a         generation!","eclairs (critical remix):l:srt:like in srt, this stage features a match point version!","raspberry cobbler:l:srtex:the deer bakery felt like it need a song so relaxing, it felt like a breath of    fresh air...","soft serve:lod:srtex:big beats, and the singers from this     track were from freesound.org!","the song that kills you:l:srtex:amy's stage was supposed to be rock in   srt, and now it is!","milkshake:l:srtex:pk's stage needed a playful track, so i  tried my best, even including a 3°4      section!","klepon:l:srtex:jsona's stage is a scary cave, and what'sa cave supposed to sound like?","tiramisu:l:srtex:an alternate theme for niko, a slower    jazz track.","pound cake:l:srtex:an alternate theme for the milk bar, i   thought a ragtime version would be funny!","pound cake (critical remix):l:srtex:like eclairs, i wanted to make a match   point version of it!","popsicle:l:srtex:a track made for the hamburger stage,    featuring motifs from the credits theme!","rampage 1:l:srtex:i liked the idea of having new songs for gamemodes","rampage 2:l:srtex:rampages have these dejnt-y beats to them","rampage 3:l:srtex:this one is inspired by a metallica song!","stollen:l:srtex:the red scare is here... oh dear!","grape sorbet:l:srt:another remix for srt, oh boy!","mooncake:l:srtex:there is some kind of flute here...","mooncake (critical remix):l:srtex:there is some kind of flute here...","cupcake:l:srt:an upbeat remix of an old classic...","miku and mona:l:srtex:for those rainy days... this song        features meows from my two old cats of   the same name!","cheesecake:l:srtex:a scary theme for a scary dragon..","quesitos:l:srtex:a rather rambunctious theme for a fruity feline","william's shop (he runs it):w:srtex:a playful song from william's newly      opened shop!","tembleque:l:srtex:bask in his glory, clancy's aura is too  strong, he stole the show!"],
