    Num_MD_CharacterBios: ["lemon:lemon is a small yellow cat! he is an expert of making things work..:evil punch:lemon's super attack   has lemon  hit a multi hit combo punch","deli:deli is a silly pink    kitty with a knack for  mail! stay warry of     those letters!:mailbox cannon:deli unleashes a       barrage of letters","niko:niko is a teal fox! he  swings his katana with  extreme force...:lightspeed strike:niko travels so fast   that time appears to   freeze, and unleashes  his strike","neko:neko teams up with her  cat to tag team any     opponent!:cat farm:neko unleashes her armyof cats!","nizhoni:nizhoni is an expert    merchant, her backpack  has everything you need!:the anchor:dear god, its the      anchor...","legend:legend tosses various   projectiles and runs in with his kicks!:fall out:legend drops an air    strike!","chrissy:chrissy is the son of   famous soyadi ceo. he's much more evil than his father:knife collection:chris tosses his spare knives!","krisp:krisp is a pan wielding creature, and is also   part of the fruitfurs!:card attack:krisp calls in the     fruitfurs for a strike attack!","molly:molly is a pink ice     kitty. she uses her     devastating brittle     effect to win:ice wall:molly shoots a wall of ice","pat:pat is a skilled fighterhe uses his various     tools to twist any      outcome!:confidential deer:pat flips his deer     favor, as the screen   fades to black..","boneman:boneman fights with a   buncha random stuff...  i dont know either...:unite the colors!:boneman quickly turns  vanta, and uses all thecolors!","sora:sora is a magical white fox. he uses different  spells to set up attacks:evil sora:sora turns like... evil... i dont lol","amy:amy is a fierce fightingfeline! she's really    good at that apparently.:cat strike!:amy takes you and then uhh beats you up","paperkitty:paperkitty has an       arsenal of tools... somefor scufflin'...:the fridge:pk slams the fridge!","jsona:jsona is a blue fox withwater attacks! umm gamer:bubbles!:jsona blows a ton of   bubbles","liz:liz is an underpaid cat intern! she dishes out  vegetables and cooks!:big pot:liz cooks you up in a  big pot!","mr. gummy:worm!!! worm worm worm worrrmmm!!:giant ring:mr gummy shoots a largepeach ring!","zeta:zeta is a magical purplecat! she uses lightning and the power of        hurricanes:magic spikes:zeta launches a bunch  of spikes!","tamago:tamago is a doe with a  knack for projectiles!:giant cannon:tamago fires off her   powerful beam!","random:this is the random      option... why is this   here?:santa bio:ho ho ho! hes a jolly  fellow with gifts and asleigh","vale:vale is an evil wizard  of the vault! he was    turned into an egg once ... how rude:x team up:vale summons x to help out a strong blow!","stickid:stickid loves to play   video games. he is also fast at fighting!:super punch:stickid strikes down   the opponent with speed","mali:mali is liz' grumpy     older sister. she's     never had it easy       getting a job:burg:mali eats a burger and heals","frank:frank is the newest ceo.he's not only evil, but also a powerhouse!:gattling shell:frank fires out of his shell to deal a final  blow!","mei mei:mei mei is a lucky blackcat! stay wary of her   barage of rockets...:coin pusher:mei mei teleports and  fires tons of coins","karl marx:karl is a philosopher,  and he's here to unite  the skrunkly class:hammer and sickle:both players are set toequal hp after a       massive ambush","toshi:toshi is small yellow   goat, he looks harmless at first, but we wary   when that dragon comes  out...:loud bleat:enemy player is        temporarily harmless","clancy:clancy is the hero, he'sthe greatest, everyone  loves him. of course,   everyone but toshi...:axe slam:clancy slashes and     finishes with a massiveaxe slam","???:i wish i could tell you","pictoman:pictoman is severely    disappointed. all of    these violations.  must fix. caution.:warning:pictoman gives a       warning before         exploding"],
